# Synthetic CAN frame log for the DBC end-to-end test (no hardware needed).
# Source DBC: mg100_demo.dbc in this directory (copy of Test/fixtures/mg100_demo.dbc).
# Columns: <time_s> <channel> <can_id_hex> <dlc> <payload bytes, hex>
# 0x100 = EngineData, 0x101 = BatteryStatus, 0x102 = Multiplexed.
# 0x7FF is an unknown frame; the last frame is deliberately truncated.
# '#' starts a comment.
0.100 1 0x100 8 11 22 33 44 55 66 77 88
0.200 1 0x101 8 11 22 33 44 55 66 77 88
0.300 1 0x100 8 00 10 40 00 80 00 00 00
0.400 1 0x101 8 FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF
0.500 1 0x102 8 00 08 00 00 00 00 00 00
0.600 1 0x7FF 8 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
0.700 1 0x100 2 11 22
